    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to Knockane, a beautifully presented 5 bed, 3 bath bungalow, ideally positioned in the heart of Ovens, Co. Cork, close to all amenities in Ballincollig town centre.\r\nWith a stunning interior, generous living accommodation, off street parking, and an enclosed private rear patio & garden; this property is an excellent choice for those wanting a well situated, private home that offers accessibility to central amenities.\r\nViewing is highly recommended!\r\nBER: B3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation Details:\r\n\r\nPorch & Hallway - 3.67m x 1.84m\r\nThe front door opens into a warm and welcoming entrance with herringbone flooring throughout.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.25m x 3.65m\r\nBright and airy living room with timber flooring and front aspect window overlooking mature front garden. An open fireplace provides warmth in the colder months.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Sitting - 5.43m x 2.86m & 4.51m x 3.49m & 3.71m x 2.92m\r\nThis luxury contemporary kitchen is both stylish and functional, featuring sleek cabinetry, with central island with sink and integrated appliances. The stunning dining area overlooks out the rear garden with a dual aspect area. A sitting area with picture window and sliding glass doors completes this breathtaking space. This modern renovation is sure to impress prospective buyers!\r\n\r\nGuest WC/Shower Room – 2.86m x 2.11m\r\nThis is a spacious guest W.C with full tiled floor & splashback, electric shower, WHB & W.C.\r\n\r\nUtility Room – 3.9m x 1.63m\r\nSpacious utility room, plumbed for washing machine and dryer with tiled flooring and ample storage.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom (Bedroom 1) 4.91m x 3.40m\r\nSpacious and luxury master bedroom, with timber floors, overlooking the garden. A beautifully finished and relaxing retreat.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite:\r\nFully tiled en-suite with modern industrial style enclosed shower, floating vanity, bowl sink, WHB & W.C.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 3.63m x 3.56m\r\nDouble bedroom with timber floors, alcove for fitted wardrobes and a front aspect window that provides plenty of light.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom 2.11m x 2.86m\r\nChic main bathroom with tiled walls and floor, W.H.B, W.C, built in vanity and deep soaking tub,\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 2.94m x 2.62m\r\nBright double bedroom with built in wardrobes and timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 – 5.54m x 3.54m\r\nIncredibly spacious double bedroom with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 – 2.94m x 2.17m\r\nSpacious single bedroom with wardrobes and timber flooring.\r\n\r\nGarden Details\r\nA spacious and well-maintained front garden featuring a sweeping gravel driveway with ample parking. A neatly manicured lawn, mature trees and established hedging provide an attractive, private setting.\r\n\r\nA generously sized rear garden, predominantly laid in lawn and surrounded by mature trees, hedging and established planting. A spacious paved patio provides an excellent outdoor seating and entertaining area, complete with a feature stone fireplace. The garden also includes a children’s play area, large timber shed and ample space for recreation, offering a private and versatile outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nHeating\r\nOil Central Heating"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\n\r\nNewly renovated open plan kitchen/living & dining \r\nAmple Parking\r\nLarge & Private rear garden with mature trees\r\nMinutes’ drive from Ballincollig Town Centre and The Ballincollig Regional Park \r\n2 School Buses to Primary & Secondary"
      },
      {
